This project targets IFM/K2-Horizon-375B-A23B, released by the Institute of
Foundation Models. It is an independent research tool, not an official IFM product.

The router calculation and intervention reference forward in routing.py follow
the Apache-2.0 K2HorizonSparseMoeBlock implementation distributed by IFM, derived
from the Qwen/Hugging Face implementation. Upstream notices identify the Qwen team,
Alibaba Group, and HuggingFace Inc. (Copyright 2025).

Weights and upstream Python source are downloaded at immutable revisions and are
not redistributed in this repository.
